# SfxLab family v2: layer id name type dur seed key=value... (dur 0 = endless) · range id param lo hi [note] · bind signal id|* param [lo hi] [rel] [steps=N | scale=<chord>] · note text · then `spell <id>` sections: name, recipe, the spell's layers at their lock values, its binds and notes
bench 1
root 65.4064
# pyretic: the notes are made by oscillators. Four FM voices that growl while the ratios are off and burn clean as they lock,
# over a warm, saturated drone; the fire recordings and an arc crackle are the texture. The old synth bed stays only as a haze gathered onto C and G.
